  "scope": "Existing UI workflow block in parent #7 and open implementation issues #12 through #31 only; no issue comments, state changes or unrelated body changes.",
  "source_feedback": [
    "Stretched ImageGen controls produced unequal padding on their four sides.",
    "Isolated generation ignored neighboring controls and interaction relationships.",
    "Passive container panels did not receive the ImageGen finish."
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "Start from a complete screen composition and interactive/passive surface/state inventory.",
    "Generate a coherent ImageGen family using the accepted composition, catalog and neighboring approved assets.",
    "Include passive trays, cards, modal/recovery panels and toasts in the same authored finish.",
    "Retain full original output, exact prompts, reference hashes and provenance.",
    "Do not stretch whole artwork: calibrate fixed corners/edges, symmetric content insets and safe content rectangles; stretch only documented plain spans or preserve aspect ratio; scale the family uniformly and preserve icon aspect ratio.",
    "Compare real phone and wider full-scene captures with the composition/catalog; provenance verification alone is not visual acceptance."
  ],
